<style>
  .panel-root { flex-direction: column; width: 60; padding-top: 2.4; padding-bottom: 2.4; padding-left: 2.8; padding-right: 2.8; background-color: #0b0d12f4; border-color: #D58B58; border-width: 0.1; border-radius: 0.5; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 1.05; font-weight: 700; color: #D58B58; margin-bottom: 0.5; }
  .heading { font-size: 2.1; font-weight: 700; color: #EEE9DF; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .hint { font-size: 1.25; color: #b9b5ab; margin-bottom: 0.9; }
  .target { font-size: 1.45; color: #EEE9DF; margin-bottom: 0.8; }
  .stage-btn { width: 100%; height: 3.4; background-color: #D58B58; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #0b0d12; font-size: 1.5; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .gloss { font-size: 1.1; color: #8f8c85; margin-bottom: 0.5; }
  .preview-text { font-size: 1.35; color: #EEE9DF; margin-top: 0.6; margin-bottom: 0.9; }
  .commit-btn { width: 100%; height: 3.4; background-color: #b02e2e; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.5; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .cancel-btn { width: 100%; height: 2.8; background-color: #1c2029; border-radius: 0.4; justify-content: center; align-items: center; color: #EEE9DF; font-size: 1.3; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.7; }
  .result-text { margin-top: 0.6; font-size: 1.3; color: #EEE9DF; }
</style>
<div class="panel-root" id="containment-root" style="display: none">
  <span class="eyebrow">INTERVENTION STATION - the one mutation path</span>
  <span class="heading">Quarantine an actor</span>
  <span class="hint" id="containment-hint">log in to commit; staging a preview needs no session</span>
  <span class="target" id="actor-row-label">target: pipeline-logs (ACTIVE)</span>
  <button class="stage-btn" id="stage-btn">Stage quarantine</button>
  <span class="gloss">preview only - nothing changes yet. Staged memories get an amber PREVIEW ring on the field.</span>
  <span class="preview-text" id="preview-text" style="display: none">​</span>
  <button class="commit-btn" id="commit-btn" style="display: none">Commit (writes to MNEME)</button>
  <button class="cancel-btn" id="cancel-btn" style="display: none">Cancel</button>
  <span class="gloss" id="commit-gloss" style="display: none">Commit is the one action that actually changes the field</span>
  <span class="result-text" id="result-text">​</span>
</div>
